# The Clerk `__client` cookie from auth.suno.com. Lives about a year; a dead
# session is usually one rotated by signing in again elsewhere.
#
# Get it: log into suno.com, devtools > Application > Cookies > auth.suno.com,
# copy the value of `__client` (suno.com itself only has `__client_uat`, a
# timestamp that Clerk rejects). A full "Cookie: ..." header pasted whole also
# works; the client extracts the field it needs.
#
# This is a live session credential whatever the account tier. Never commit it.
#
# Any tier works: the client reads the account's plan and usable models at
# runtime rather than assuming a subscription. Free accounts get fewer models
# and a 403 on subscription-only features - see docs/STATUS.md.
SUNO_COOKIE=

# Optional: where the client persists its session (default: XDG config, 0600).
# SUNO_AUTH_FILE=/run/secrets/suno-auth.json
